{
  "_comment": [
    "Every NEW Milestone 3 sound event (docs/MILESTONE_3.md section 16). Owned by the lead; workers request changes.",
    "Ids that section 16 marks 'existing, reused' (story.lesson_complete) are not listed and keep their M1 or M2 audio.",
    "feature: the recipe module tools/assets/sounds/<feature>.py whose FILES entry renders this id. Until that entry exists,",
    "gen_sounds.py renders a labelled placeholder into <group>/<name>[1..variants] (see gen_sounds.py --m3 --placeholders).",
    "loop: every file is rendered as a seamless loop. stream: written into sounds.json as \"stream\": true (long beds and music).",
    "volume goes into sounds.json when it is not 1.0. variants: the number of placeholder files (default 1).",
    "Run python3 tools/assets/gen_sounds.py --m3 --java after editing, then commit the audio, sounds.json, lang part and ModSounds."
  ],
